# BeMyShopper Project Specification

Project Name: BeMyShopper
Directory: /Users/neelamvishwanatham/Documents/bemyshopper
Type: On-Demand Grocery & Personal Errand Service Website
Framework: Next.js 16 + React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS

Core Capabilities:
- Local Store Catalog & Aisles
- Live Shopping Cart with Out-of-Stock Substitution Rules
- Custom Errand & Pickup Concierge
- Live Shopper Tracking & In-Aisle Messaging Simulation
- Shopper Partner Recruitment

Commands:
- Run dev server: npm run dev
- Build production: npm run build
- Start production: npm start
